{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"身体性的渴望接在 H12、H14 所确立的自主承认与持续想念上，而渴望转为心疼、心疼未减喜欢并延续到下一次热切，又由 H7、H12 和 M42、M43 得到解释，没有新增事件或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"独自回味时出现身体余韵、欲望与不愿抽身的心理过程，可以接在 H13 的回望、H14 的持续想念及 H12、M25 所支持的无需回应也能成立的快乐上，属于允许补充的局部因果桥，没有新增往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"舍不得来自已有的时间意识、对快乐消逝的担忧及仍然高兴时便开始心疼的体验（H6、H8、H11），M30、M26 又把重复经历如何加深时间感说清楚，没有把音乐变化当成心理原因或改写主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条都明确写出了当下的感受及其心理成因，H、M 编号只是辅助依据，即使不看听感记录，也能理解各自的情绪发展与因果关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "eca8aa91-0eb8-4947-b4ed-209523f2792d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T143940485226Z", "elapsed_seconds": 202.875, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:43:03.366548+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d31a30ca50379fef403e44e08c88be6a11abcbc7ceeac6cfc4bd69b806dd271e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\cha